d card onto the battlefield.","oracle_id":"6c022656-2b97-46c5-8f7b-72a71996457a","published_at":"2010-06-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Kindred is a card type that allows noncreature cards to have creature types. For example, Echoes of Eternity is an Eldrazi (although not a creature) while on the battlefield and an Eldrazi card (although not a creature card) in zones other than the battlefield.","oracle_id":"cf890abd-b282-4dbb-ac86-9e7caec1c1b8","published_at":"2024-06-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This cards was originally printed with the \"tribal\" card type. That card type has been replaced with \"kindred\". This change does not affect the gameplay function of this card.","oracle_id":"cf890abd-b282-4dbb-ac86-9e7caec1c1b8","published_at":"2024-06-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"While it appears only on cards that already have other card types, kindred is a card type and will be counted by effects that refer to the number of card types among cards in a zone.","oracle_id":"cf890abd-b282-4dbb-ac86-9e7caec1c1b8","published_at":"2024-06-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Although you may want to include Lessons in your sideboard if you're playing with cards that instruct you to learn, Lesson cards can be included in your main deck like other instant or sorcery cards.","oracle_id":"f6e0cb77-4115-4948-8e1e-fdb774b1b254","published_at":"2021-04-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Lesson is a spell subtype found on some instant and sorcery cards in the Strixhaven set. The Lesson subtype has no special rules associated with it.","oracle_id":"f6e0cb77-4115-4948-8e1e-fdb774b1b254","published_at":"2021-04-16","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
